---
layout: base.njk
title: Roofing Advice & News
description: Read practical roofing advice from Dry Roofs on replacement roofing, flat roofing choices and when to book repairs.
permalink: /blog/index.html
---
<section class="border-b border-stone-200 bg-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 lg:px-8 lg:py-20">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand">Blog</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-5xl text-slate-950">Roofing Advice &amp; News</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">Useful guidance on roof replacement, flat roofing and practical repair planning.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20 lg:px-8">
  <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
    {% for post in posts %}
      <article class="flex h-full flex-col rounded-[1.75rem] border border-stone-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand">{{ post.date }}</p>
        <h2 class="mt-5 text-2xl text-slate-950">{{ post.title }}</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 flex-1 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600">{{ post.excerpt }}</p>
        <a href="/blog/{{ post.slug }}/" class="mt-6 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-brand hover:text-brand-dark">Read article →</a>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
